  "title": "Chime to Announce Second Quarter 2026 Financial Results on August 5, 2026",
  "summary": "SAN FRANCISCO --(BUSINESS WIRE)--Jul. 16, 2026-- Chime ® (Nasdaq: CHYM) will release financial results for the second quarter 2026 on August 5, 2026 after market close. Chime will hold a conference call to discuss the results at 3:00 p.m. Pacific Time ( 6:00 p.m. Eastern Time) on the same day.",
